sequenceDiagram
    participant App as AI Application
    participant G as Search Gateway
    participant P as Request Policy
    participant S as Search Provider
    participant C as Content Renderer
    App->>G: Search request
    G->>P: Validate key, host and limits
    P-->>G: Allow or reject
    G->>S: Search
    S-->>G: Result links
    G->>C: Retrieve selected content
    C-->>G: Rendered content
    G-->>App: Normalized response

